+// Pre-barrier and phase shift for loop 1.
+// CHECK: ttg.barrier local
+// CHECK: amdg.cond_barrier
+// CHECK: scf.for
+// Wrap-around barrier inside loop 1.
+// CHECK: ttg.barrier local
